{'symbol': 'J', 'date': '2022-10-04 04:00:00', 'title': 'JACOBS WINS NATIONAL GRID DESIGN & PROJECT SERVICES FRAMEWORK', 'text': 'FRAMEWORK TO INCREASE THE RESILIENCY AND CAPACITY NEEDED IN THE ELECTRICITY TRANSMISSION NETWORK SUPPORTS UK EFFORTS TO MEET NET-ZERO AND DECARBONIZATION COMMITMENTS DALLAS , OCT. 4, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- JACOBS\xa0(NYSE:J) WAS AWARDED THE DESIGN & PROJECT SERVICES FRAMEWORK WITH ENERGY UTILITY NATIONAL GRID\xa0IN THE U.K. TO SUPPORT THEIR FULL CONSTRUCTION OF THE ELECTRICITY AND GAS TRANSMISSION CYCLE. THROUGH THE NEW FOUR-YEAR FRAMEWORK, JACOBS WILL PROVIDE FEASIBILITY AND SURVEY WORKS, FRONT-END CONCEPTUAL AND DETAILED DESIGN, THROUGH TO ASSURANCE, VERIFICATION AND COMMISSIONING SERVICES.'}